+++ b/drivers/media/platform/sprd/vsp/Kconfig
@@ -16,5 +16,8 @@
 	  EXPERIMENTAL stateless H.264 decoder (intra slices only for now) written
 	  from a reverse-engineered register map; it has not been verified on hardware.
 
+	  The JPEG codec gets a V4L2 memory-to-memory decoder for baseline JPEG
+	  (4:2:0, 4:2:2, 4:4:4 and greyscale, standard Huffman tables only).
+
 	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module
